'''Body armour''' is a type of [[Armour (equipment)|armour]] equipment. Like [[shields]], body armours have inherent [[movement speed]] penalties. In general, all STR and STR/INT body armours come with a larger reduced movement speed penalty and all other body armours have a smaller penalty.

Some top tier Body Armour don't have this hidden movement speed penalties at all: e.g. {{il|Glorious Plate}}, {{il|Assassin's Garb}}, etc.

